OL,3,GNorth West                             
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA breezy     
OL,6,Fnight with thickening cloud, and       
OL,7,Fspells of light rain after midnight.   
OL,8,FFeeling cold, but without the risk of  
OL,9,Ffrost for coasts and cities. Further   
OL,10,Finland, mainly for the fells, a touch  
OL,11,Fof frost.                              
OL,13,CTuesday:FFeeling cold and breezy.      
OL,14,FCloudy with spells of rain, some       
OL,15,Fheavier spells over Cumbria. A slight  
OL,16,Frisk of snow and icy roads over the    
OL,17,FPennines during the morning.           
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
