OL,3,GNorth West                             
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FOn    
OL,6,FWednesday, dry, cloudy and cold.       
OL,7,FLonger breaks to bright or sunny       
OL,8,Fspells on Thursday, but cold again.    
OL,9,FRain, strengthening winds, and hill    
OL,10,Fsnow returning later on Friday.        
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
